      "content": "Calf-high or knee-high boots or light coverings for the foot and leg, typically made from cloth or leather. May be made of decorated silk or other fine fabric; may fit inside a shoe like a stocking; sometimes forming part of the regalia of a monarch or eccesiastic. [Source: Getty AAT]"
